      "answer": "road-car",
      "then": {
        "highlight": "road-car",
        "say": "The car on the main road goes first. You are driving onto the main road from a driveway, so you wait and let the car pass."
      },
      "rule": "When you enter a main road from a driveway, an alley, a parking lot or the roadside, you yield to all vehicles already on the main road."
